# =============================================================================
# Docker build context ignore list
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anything listed here is NOT sent to the Docker daemon as part of the build
# context, and is NOT copied into the image by the Dockerfile's `COPY . .`.
#
# Rules of thumb:
#   * Never ship secrets or VCS metadata into an image.
#   * Keep generated/heavy trees (vendor, node_modules, caches, logs) OUT of
#     the context — they would otherwise invalidate build-cache layers and
#     bloat the image. vendor/ is baked separately by `composer install` in
#     the Dockerfile, and /var/www/vendor is an anonymous volume at runtime.
#   * The docker/ tree MUST stay in context: the Dockerfile explicitly copies
#     docker/entrypoint.sh and docker/worker-bootstrap.sh out of it.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VCS / IDE metadata
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
*.swo

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment / secrets
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .env contains local secrets (APP_KEY, DB_PASSWORD...) and must never be baked.
# .env.example and docker/.env.docker are safe templates — keep them so the
# entrypoint can recreate .env at first boot.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!docker/.env.docker

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependency trees — installed and managed outside the build context
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
vendor
node_modules

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Documentation / tooling (not needed at runtime)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.md
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
composer.phar

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compose / Docker tooling (the repo root files are not app runtime files)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.yaml
docker-compose.*.yml
docker-compose.*.yaml

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Laravel runtime artifacts — churn quickly and bust the build cache
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
storage/logs/*
storage/framework/cache/*
storage/framework/sessions/*
storage/framework/views/*
!storage/logs/.gitkeep
!storage/framework/cache/.gitkeep
!storage/framework/sessions/.gitkeep
!storage/framework/views/.gitkeep

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build tooling / test artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.phpunit.cache
.phpunit.result.cache
composer.lock.md5
public/hot
public/build
debug/bar

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows reserved-name junk (a stray `curl -o NUL` in a bind-mounted dir)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
NUL
NUL.txt
nul